  "_comment": "Merge this into %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Packages\\Microsoft.WindowsTerminal_*\\LocalState\\settings.json — or open Settings with Ctrl+, → Open JSON file and paste. The scheme comes from .config/kitty/theme.conf, so both terminals are the same greys. 'opacity' and 'padding' come from modules/user.lua."
}
